   "roundness": null,
   "text": "87 distributions.  373 MB.\n\npandas \u00b7 plotly \u00b7 numpy \u00b7 selenium \u00b7 lxml. strictdoc itself is\n18 MB of that. every consuming project owes all of it, because\nTECH-001 puts the state in the user's repo, so the tool runs there.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "87 distributions.  373 MB.\n\npandas \u00b7 plotly \u00b7 numpy \u00b7 selenium \u00b7 lxml. strictdoc itself is\n18 MB of that. every consuming project owes all of it, because\nTECH-001 puts the state in the user's repo, so the tool runs there.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
